1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 3=

4
00:00:58,390 --> 00:00:59,470
Then neither of us gets what we want.

5
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:01,600
Let's start over!

6
00:01:03,150 --> 00:01:03,600
Don't you dare!

7
00:01:25,350 --> 00:01:31,490
♪One thought of youth, laughing side
by side, I made a promise with you♪

8
00:01:32,350 --> 00:01:38,920
♪One wish left unfulfilled, so close,
yet no words can be spoken♪

9
00:01:39,140 --> 00:01:45,090
♪Leaving one soul alone, looking back
again between heaven and earth♪

10
00:01:45,440 --> 00:01:52,860
♪How should I remember?
How should I say goodbye?♪

11
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:56,150
Why would you...

12
00:02:00,140 --> 00:02:06,900
♪One thought waits for the snow,
shining bright in my memories♪

13
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,360
He Xiaoyuan.

14
00:02:09,910 --> 00:02:11,750
Do you think dying will set you free?

15
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:13,630
For the past thirty-three lifetimes,

16
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:16,000
why did your parents die so young?

17
00:02:16,630 --> 00:02:17,080
It was because

18
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:19,080
you were only the daughter
of an obscure minor official.

19
00:02:21,030 --> 00:02:22,360
Did any of those renowned physicians

20
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:24,400
from the Imperial Medical Service
ever treat your parents?

21
00:02:29,190 --> 00:02:30,870
(Imperial Medical Service)
Imperial Physician, please save them.

22
00:02:31,090 --> 00:02:32,660
- Please save my parents.
- There's really nothing I can do.

23
00:02:32,660 --> 00:02:33,310
I'm begging you.

24
00:02:33,310 --> 00:02:33,910
Stop begging me.

25
00:02:33,910 --> 00:02:34,520
Please.

26
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,640
There's really nothing I can do.

27
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:39,750
What if I kneel before you?

28
00:02:40,540 --> 00:02:44,420
(Tomb of My Late Father, He Jingchuan)

29
00:02:44,530 --> 00:02:48,850
♪Shining bright in my memories♪

30
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,240
Mother.

31
00:02:51,410 --> 00:02:54,860
♪With no regrets for this chapter♪

32
00:02:54,870 --> 00:02:57,080
Mother.

33
00:02:57,080 --> 00:03:01,700
♪Someday, when we meet again♪

34
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:03,310
As long as
you become the Crown Princess,

35
00:03:03,870 --> 00:03:04,710
those renowned physicians

36
00:03:05,590 --> 00:03:06,520
will kneel before you,

37
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:08,280
begging to treat your parents.

38
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:09,910
You'll have an endless supply

39
00:03:10,310 --> 00:03:11,430
of rare medicinal herbs.

40
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:13,360
Death

41
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,280
is an escape for the weak.

42
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:16,630
But power

43
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:19,240
is the foundation of survival.

44
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:21,630
Promise me.

45
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:24,280
You must stay alive.

46
00:03:31,470 --> 00:03:32,280
I promise.

47
00:03:34,910 --> 00:03:35,710
Say it again.

48
00:03:40,630 --> 00:03:41,840
I

49
00:03:42,750 --> 00:03:44,400
promise Your Highness

50
00:03:48,630 --> 00:03:49,710
that I will

51
00:03:51,030 --> 00:03:53,150
become the Crown Princess.

52
00:03:58,120 --> 00:04:02,370
♪Can I still hope that someday♪

53
00:04:05,070 --> 00:04:09,200
♪We'll meet again?♪

54
00:04:22,750 --> 00:04:24,390
Remember what you said today.

55
00:04:28,260 --> 00:04:28,970
Return to the palace.

56
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:36,680
(That ruthless monster)

57
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:38,270
(actually risked his own life)

58
00:04:39,070 --> 00:04:40,480
(to save me)

59
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:42,360
(back there.)

60
00:04:44,380 --> 00:04:47,220
(Qingyan Palace)

61
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:04,360
All right.

62
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:08,190
This is what you've accomplished

63
00:05:08,190 --> 00:05:09,310
after half a month of studying?

64
00:05:16,310 --> 00:05:17,720
I refuse to believe

65
00:05:17,950 --> 00:05:19,240
that drawing eyebrows

66
00:05:19,830 --> 00:05:21,070
is harder than ruling a kingdom.

67
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:34,430
A little higher. Yes.

68
00:05:52,630 --> 00:05:53,480
You...

69
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:57,390
Take a look.

70
00:05:57,510 --> 00:05:58,630
I think it's all right.

71
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:08,510
What's wrong?

72
00:06:14,270 --> 00:06:16,190
It's so ugly I could cry.

73
00:06:16,190 --> 00:06:16,870
No...

74
00:06:19,750 --> 00:06:20,830
Fu Yang.

75
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:23,260
Go to the market and find me

76
00:06:23,260 --> 00:06:24,040
the Beauty Illustrated Guide,

77
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:24,720
and

78
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:26,430
the Makeup Manual.

79
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:27,310
Bring them all back

80
00:06:27,310 --> 00:06:28,040
to me.

81
00:06:31,830 --> 00:06:32,430
Well...

82
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,360
Later,

83
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:34,560
I'll

84
00:06:35,430 --> 00:06:36,240
do a better job.

85
00:06:52,860 --> 00:06:53,820
(Crescent Brows)

86
00:06:53,830 --> 00:06:54,830
Mandarin Duck Brows.

87
00:06:54,830 --> 00:06:55,660
(Mandarin Duck Brows)

88
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:58,070
Crescent Brows.

89
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:07,680
(I'm so hungry.)

90
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:11,040
(I miss Father's chicken soup,)

91
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:12,070
(Mother's pork ribs...)

92
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,720
(It's almost dark.)

93
00:07:15,190 --> 00:07:18,160
(How much longer
is His Highness going to study?)

94
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:21,310
I've got it.

95
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,360
Come here.

96
00:07:26,980 --> 00:07:32,680
♪I still remember
the fragrance of Lingnan lychees♪

97
00:07:33,440 --> 00:07:39,040
♪The uneven stone steps,
mottled and damp with morning dew♪

98
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:42,080
♪Amid the bustling streets,
life was warm and full♪

99
00:07:42,390 --> 00:07:45,230
♪I wished only for a simple,
contented life♪

100
00:07:45,570 --> 00:07:49,170
♪One lamp saw us through the seasons,
never feeling the hardship♪

101
00:07:49,190 --> 00:07:50,310
(What's going on?)

102
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:52,070
(When this murderous monster)

103
00:07:52,070 --> 00:07:53,430
(isn't out to kill anyone,)

104
00:07:54,190 --> 00:07:55,390
(he actually)

105
00:07:55,830 --> 00:07:57,040
(looks rather handsome.)

106
00:07:58,960 --> 00:08:04,430
♪But a document signed
by mistake sent you far away♪

107
00:08:04,670 --> 00:08:07,630
♪The pounding hooves
faded too quickly to stop♪

108
00:08:07,900 --> 00:08:10,790
♪I swallowed my tears,
not daring to speak♪

109
00:08:11,180 --> 00:08:16,410
♪The Lingnan mist
chilled our old home through♪

110
00:08:17,110 --> 00:08:22,990
♪Since we parted, our hearts
have gone separate ways♪

111
00:08:23,460 --> 00:08:25,760
♪The palace crushed♪

112
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:30,270
♪A true heart and made it a wager♪

113
00:08:30,270 --> 00:08:37,280
♪The crescent moon mourns
a noble heart given in vain♪

114
00:08:37,740 --> 00:08:45,580
♪The land remains unchanged, but beneath
Chang'an's walls, loneliness endures♪

115
00:08:47,390 --> 00:08:52,450
♪When you return,
the kapok flowers will bloom♪

116
00:08:52,870 --> 00:08:53,460
Look.

117
00:08:53,460 --> 00:08:57,440
♪And tell of our longing♪

118
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:10,790
Is that really me?

119
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,630
Well, Silly He?

120
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,270
I'm pretty good at this, aren't I?

121
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:32,390
(First trial run.)

122
00:09:32,870 --> 00:09:33,440
(He Xiaoyuan,)

123
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:34,960
(you'd better not let me down.)

124
00:09:37,390 --> 00:09:39,550
(All you have to do
is catch the Crown Prince's eye.)

125
00:09:39,670 --> 00:09:40,360
(He Xiaoyuan,)

126
00:09:40,870 --> 00:09:41,910
(you can do this.)

127
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,670
This ink is rather unusual.

128
00:10:16,900 --> 00:10:19,210
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

129
00:10:19,560 --> 00:10:21,250
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

130
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:24,890
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

131
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:29,730
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

132
00:10:29,730 --> 00:10:32,470
♪My heart has long known♪

133
00:10:32,940 --> 00:10:34,910
♪We made a promise long ago♪

134
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:36,860
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

135
00:10:37,530 --> 00:10:40,850
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

136
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:44,010
♪How much must I let go♪

137
00:10:44,330 --> 00:10:46,010
♪For one moment♪

138
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:49,020
♪To hold each other close♪

139
00:10:49,230 --> 00:10:53,550
♪Would that be enough?♪
